    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1405110445/v0.2.5</id>
    <updated>2026-10-09T14:02:00Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/releases/tag/v0.2.5"/>
    <title>v0.2.5</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;[0.2.5] - 2026-10-09&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-note find, inbox delete, today entry point, inbox + capture cleanup (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/1ed3edc5f2d9684cdd43d057fb0a1427ce815bb5&quot;&gt;1ed3edc&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Today section on home dashboard with quick-append (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/b50876aa5ec332fd13fa783a4732037bc9bed8a0&quot;&gt;b50876a&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Single continuous live-preview editor, no blocks, no raw mode (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/9b35b3851f18dbaa32cf2244006d11dd03d761d6&quot;&gt;9b35b38&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opaque popup/modal backgrounds so text can&#39;t bleed through (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/e7d4d49a68d2c3982a901e6def7bf7abd4203003&quot;&gt;e7d4d49&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revert capture restyle, keep original + hairline border (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/9fcf1198cb4a8728f05e776703d6cae241be3718&quot;&gt;9fcf119&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Redux live captions resilience, visibility, warm-up (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/033f5f765969768f765b05dd529b6105ca9355b0&quot;&gt;033f5f7&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Live view selection-safe blocks, dblclick/Enter/gutter to edit (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/854d1ad2758a6ccc9093bee12c173167bb43f70a&quot;&gt;854d1ad&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rendered bullets/tasks, tighter headings aligned to gutter (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/7b274acdac6f13f4a4ba2d6e25465cc784bc52db&quot;&gt;7b274ac&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Near-body heading scale so gutter numbers sit with text (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/6efeb8bc67b7040685a075a0b009dbdfca86ce2f&quot;&gt;6efeb8b&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Body-size bold headings so every line aligns with gutter (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/dae5c1a974f0368d620e365c0160c67e99e17b5a&quot;&gt;dae5c1a&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gutter numbers track content half-leading via --ed-fs (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/2d4d2c2d8fad8d419a354aa8d64214f42540ab3d&quot;&gt;2d4d2c2&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Performance&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(android)&lt;/strong&gt; Speed up sidebar and vault refresh (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/3dc513407a1e79d3d6ba7a475c69ab0b0146ea9e&quot;&gt;3dc5134&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
