  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/1405110445/v0.2.4</id>
    <updated>2026-10-09T14:03:00Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/releases/tag/v0.2.4"/>
    <title>v0.2.4</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;[0.2.4] - 2026-10-08&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(ui)&lt;/strong&gt; Show app version in sidebar footer, like Blobfish (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5763604147&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/issues/39&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PylotLight/Inkfish/pull/39/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/pull/39&quot;&gt;#39&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/b805b6b9b762097ba1a75f29373f2e15bd560de8&quot;&gt;b805b6b&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Documentation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add Inkfish README screenshot (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/d519c2112e85890a7390e559e7bd5ac7cda35447&quot;&gt;d519c21&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clarify folder tree hierarchy; show nested child dirs on Android (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/613c8c2e7beeaefad6d21c7e22e93332f8a95cff&quot;&gt;613c8c2&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ignore cluster-fetched Inkfish.apk (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/19a7ede21f422c278b2bf02a7986d099bd9d84bf&quot;&gt;19a7ede&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cluster APK: stamp version/versionCode from root package.json (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/8ae0b33747f5c5e880df90f69266dbe24525a708&quot;&gt;8ae0b33&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cluster APK: absolute app.json path for version stamping (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/cd626f64b386ee1c77db20cd009a352945c655e9&quot;&gt;cd626f6&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fetch cluster APK into android/build/output via helper pod (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/b776dc5cdc65632e3235c1df6984f003a40d617e&quot;&gt;b776dc5&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heal case-duplicate folders; watch vault for out-of-app changes (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/7fdbf3ec0be9b28b162f4b80fe8497470526dba9&quot;&gt;7fdbf3e&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cluster APK drops straight into android/build/output via hostPath (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/fcd295aa1355509168f120f844ae1943629951cc&quot;&gt;fcd295a&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sync history log on both apps; harden apply against mid-sync races (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/ced8c83a63e7b548d2546192fc5db67d22221f52&quot;&gt;ced8c83&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android sidebar: filename titles, faster folders, file/folder CRUD (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5756710654&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/issues/37&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PylotLight/Inkfish/pull/37/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/pull/37&quot;&gt;#37&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/cab314f9ba463607ddf7acc2b29aa557b1b6b0db&quot;&gt;cab314f&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local builds always regenerate native project (fresh launcher icon) (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5756777070&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/issues/38&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PylotLight/Inkfish/pull/38/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/pull/38&quot;&gt;#38&lt;/a&gt;) (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/commit/052702600b7bd701563767e3af7fd963ed89f12d&quot;&gt;0527026&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
