    <title>Android 0.2.4</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;Inkfish for Android 0.2.4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android: local builds always regenerate native project (fresh launcher icon) (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5756777070&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/issues/38&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PylotLight/Inkfish/pull/38/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/pull/38&quot;&gt;#38&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Android sidebar: filename titles, faster folders, file/folder CRUD (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5756710654&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/issues/37&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/PylotLight/Inkfish/pull/37/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/PylotLight/Inkfish/pull/37&quot;&gt;#37&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sync history log on both apps; harden apply against mid-sync races&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cluster APK drops straight into android/build/output via hostPath&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Heal case-duplicate folders; watch vault for out-of-app changes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docs: fetch cluster APK into android/build/output via helper pod&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cluster APK: absolute app.json path for version stamping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cluster APK: stamp version/versionCode from root package.json&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clarify folder tree hierarchy; show nested child dirs on Android&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
